    H --> P[Submit Incident Report]
    H --> Q[Announcements Feed]
    H --> R[Verify Document]
    H --> S[Chatbot / Profile]

    I --> T[Pending Requests Queue]
    I --> U[Generate Draft / Invoice]
    I --> V[Release Document]

    J --> W[Pending Payments Queue]
    J --> X[Confirm / Reject Payment]

    K --> Y[Captain Approval Queue]
